# Generated mirrors. Each has exactly one writer — a `make copy-*` target that runs ahead of every
# build — and none of them is a source. Edit the package, not the mirror; `make check-shared-ui`
# fails the build if the taxpert mirror drifts.
src/main/resources/benefits-enrollment/website-static/vendor/taxpert/
src/main/resources/benefits-enrollment/website-static/vendor/uswds-3.13.0/

# The Fact Graph browser bundle is the exception: it is committed, as it is in the other two
# applications here. Nothing publishes it, so without a copy in git this application has no engine
# in the browser until someone builds fact-graph and runs `make copy-fg`. Its sourcemap is ignored
# by the rule at the repository root, since it is four megabytes of debug aid rather than a runtime
# dependency.

